# Gardenia Kos — Kos Putri Gardenia

Laravel 12 kos management app (putri-only boarding house).

## Stack
- **Backend:** Laravel 12, PHP 8.2+, MySQL/SQLite
- **Frontend:** Tailwind CSS CDN, Alpine.js 3.x CDN, Blade
- **Icons:** `App\Support\Icons` (SVG inline via `{!! \App\Support\Icons::get('name') !!}`)
- **Facilities:** `App\Support\RoomFacilities::all()` — hardcoded per-kamar

## Design tokens
- Primary: `#2F4538` (dark green), hover: `#26392E`
- Background: `#FAF7F2` (warm cream)
- Font: Playfair Display (headings `.font-display`), Inter (body)
- Radius: `rounded-2xl` untuk card, `rounded-full` untuk button/pill

## Authentication
- Modal popup (gak ada halaman login/register terpisah)
- `AuthenticatedSessionController@create` redirect ke home dengan flash `open_auth`
- Admin middleware: `App\Http\Middleware\AdminMiddleware` (ngecek `auth()->user()->isAdmin()`)
- User model: `$user->role === 'admin'` via `isAdmin()` helper

## Layouts
| Layout | Untuk | Navbar dropdown |
|--------|-------|-----------------|
| `layouts/admin.blade.php` | Area admin (kelola kamar, booking, pembayaran, testimoni) | `<x-user-nav-dropdown />` |
| `layouts/user.blade.php` | User login (dashboard, booking, riwayat, profil) | `<x-user-nav-dropdown />` |
| `layouts/app.blade.php` | Publik (beranda, kamar, tentang, auth modal) | `<x-user-nav-dropdown />` + `@guest` guard |

## Key components (2 aja — sisanya udah dibersihkan)
- `<x-user-nav-dropdown />` — dropdown navbar kanan, auto-detect role. Items: Dashboard Admin (admin only), Profil (all), Riwayat (non-admin only), Keluar (all)
- `<x-user-avatar :user="auth()->user()" size="sm|md|lg" />` — avatar lingkaran, fallback inisial
- `@include('components.booking-detail-modal')` — modal detail booking di admin dashboard (Alpine.js store `$store.bookingModal`)

## Routes
- `routes/web.php` — publik + user (prefix `user.`) + admin (prefix `admin.` dengan middleware `auth` + `admin`)
- `routes/auth.php` — Breeze scaffolding (sebagian broken: auth views dihapus tapi controller redirect ke home untuk login/register)

## Admin panel
- **Dashboard:** stat cards + recent bookings table + pending payments
- **Kelola Kamar:** CRUD + upload foto + facility attach + toggle availability
- **Pembayaran:** verify/reject dengan booking status sync
- **Testimoni:** CRUD (admin-managed, bukan user-submitted)

## User flow
Booking → pilih kamar → isi form → booking pending → upload bukti bayar → admin verifikasi → booking confirmed → kamar unavailable

## Storage
- `config/filesystems.php` — public disk root di `public_path('storage')` (langsung, bukan symlink — buat shared hosting InfinityFree)
- Upload paths: `avatars/`, `rooms/`, `payments/`

## Known quirks
- Tailwind & Alpine via CDN (gak ada build step, gak ada Vite di production)
- Breeze components dihapus sebagian (dropdown, nav-link, auth views tinggal controller doang)
- `components/navbar.blade.php` udah dihapus (dead code)
- `Booking::generateCode()` dihapus — kode booking dibuat inline di `BookingController::store()`

